# The enclave pushing a finished verification back to the proxy, 2026-09-07.
#
# This closes CRE-9 in docs/spikes/cre.md. The proxy cannot poll for a
# workflow's result — Chainlink documents no endpoint for reading one — so the
# workflow POSTs it to a callback the proxy serves, correlated by requestId.
# This is that round trip, run for real: `cre workflow simulate verify --listen`
# in confidential mode, a trigger carrying a callbackUrl, and the proxy's own
# callback route receiving it.
#
# What it demonstrates:
#   - the enclave can reach an outbound URL and authenticate with a bearer;
#   - `requestId` correlates the callback to the waiting request;
#   - the provider's response body arrives intact at the proxy, which is what
#     the paid leg relays to the agent.
#
# ============================ proxy side ============================

